## High-Level Technical Design

**Constraint classes (geometric asymmetry):**

```mermaid
graph TD
  subgraph Water phase (fine, R_w)
    W[water particles] -- "PBF density rho0*(1-as), own radius h, porosity floor" --> W
  end
  subgraph Sand phase (coarse, R_s)
    S[grain particles] -- "rigid XPBD contact + friction" --> S
  end
  W -. "porosity field a_s + residual resistance (kernel h_c)" .-> S
  S -. "a_s modulates water density target (floored)" .-> W
  W == "symmetric-pair exponential Darcy drag" ==> S
  S == "equal+opposite pair impulse (vel_frozen)" ==> W
  P[buoyancy: -V*gradP, separate, not double-counted] --- S
  X[NO water-sand sphere collision]:::x
  classDef x fill:#511,stroke:#a33,color:#fff
```

**Per-substep pass order (REVISED — drag before exclusion removal). Bold = changed from today.**

```
predict
water density loop (×water_iters):
    [regrid + reorder every k]
    compute_fractions        → a_s over h_c            (KTD-5 wider kernel)
    compute_boundary (solids)
    compute_lambda           → rho0*(1-a_s), **porosity floor**, **own radius h**  (KTD-2,5)
    compute_dp
    exclude_water/grain      → **present until U2 lands; removed after drag (U3) is in**
    apply_dp                 → **grain dp=0 once exclusion removed**
drag subiters (×drag_subiters):
    compute_coupling_scale   → **aggregate beta_i + normalization into coupling_scale vec2**  (KTD-3,8)
    vel→vel_frozen
    drag_water / drag_grain  → **symmetric pair exponential impulse, resolution-normalized**   (KTD-3,4)
    apply_drag_pred
buoyancy:                    → **separate, not double-counted; hydrostatic-rest gate**  (KTD-7)
bed contact loop: bed_project + apply_dp                (unchanged — sand-sand)
finalize                     → **normalized, decaying wake criterion**                  (KTD-9)
xsph (water)                 (resolution normalization — watched)
wetting / extraction / fines (unchanged scalar layers)
```

**Symmetric-pair exponential drag (directional pseudo-code, not spec):**

```
# Pass A (compute_coupling_scale): per particle i, over opposite phase j in h_c
eps_i      = clamp(1 - alpha_s[i], 0.35, 0.999)
beta_i     = 150 * mu * (1-eps_i)^2 / (eps_i^3 * d^2)        # reduced units, calibrated scale
norm_i     = Σ_j W(h_c)_ij * V_j                              # aggregate normalization
coupling_scale[i] = vec2(beta_i, norm_i)                      # KTD-8 lanes

# Pass B (drag_grain / drag_water): symmetric pair impulse off vel_frozen
beta_ij    = harmonic(beta_i, beta_j)                         # symmetric combiner
tau_ij     = m_eff_pair / (beta_ij * V_pair)
J_ij       = (1 - exp(-dt / tau_ij)) * m_eff_pair * (vf[j] - vf[i]) * (W_ij / norm_aggregate)
vel[i]    += (+/-) J_ij / m_i                                 # mirrored: +J/m_i on i, -J/m_j on j
fluid_impulse[i] += |J_ij| (for the normalized wake gate, KTD-9)
```

